================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

data/wordlist.txt, data/valid-guesses.txt, and the daily-word schedule in
zborle_bot/words.py are taken from Зборле (https://github.com/zborle/wordle),
which is a fork of https://github.com/hannahcode/wordle and is distributed
under the MIT license reproduced above. The Macedonian dictionary behind those
lists is published at https://github.com/zborle/words-mk.

fonts/NotoSans-Bold.ttf is part of the Noto fonts project and is licensed under
the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full text is included alongside it
at fonts/LICENSE-NotoSans.txt.

The overall bot structure follows https://github.com/JaredIsaacs/worlde-discord.
That project publishes no license, so no code from it is reproduced here; this
implementation was written from scratch.
